ubagent in evaluator-library MUST NEVER see the generator transcript."],"rejected_paths":["tool-output compactor \u2014 rtk + caveman cover this layer. Removed from Tier 1 scope mid-session (commit c79e5b3 rationale).","Catalyst as Company Brain competitor \u2014 saturated ecosystem. Bridge via Tier 3 brain-bridge instead.","Generic harness scaffolder \u2014 Harness Engineer plugin already ships init/doctor/gc/onboard. Do not compete.","Autonomous-loop / /goal replacement \u2014 Claude Code platform owns this; wrong shape for Catalyst collaborative-first positioning.","Skipping evals \u2014 every Tier 1 skill has evals committed BEFORE the SKILL.md per EDD. Tier 2 must follow same rule."],"open_risks":["Tier 2 failure-pattern-detector overlaps with Tier 3 session-degradation-watch on repeated-tool-call + stale-read signals.","Plugin marketplace risk: ClawHavoc (Jan 2026) \u2014 skill-supply-chain-audit (Tier 4) has not shipped.","Hook portability: macOS date -j vs Linux date -d. Windows native not supported (POSIX bash only).","Auto-bump pipeline depends on GitHub Actions firing on push. Has glitched once (commit ecc3408); manual gh workflow run is the escape hatch."]},"files_read_first":[{"path":"docs/ROADMAP.md","why":"10-skill roadmap, status of each tier, design principles, what-NOT-to-build"},{"path":"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-24-tier-2-orchestration-extensions-design.md","why":"Tier 2 spec (what to build next)"},{"path":"CLAUDE.md","why":"repo conventions (commit format, EDD ordering, skill layout, hook authoring rules)"},{"path":"docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-24-tier-1-harness-primitives.md","why":"Tier 1 plan as the template for Tier 2 plan structure"},{"path":"skills/handoff/SKILL.md","why":"handoff v0.3 (4 modes + PIPELINE) \u2014 the skill you are about to invoke"},{"path":"skills/verify-gate/SKILL.md","why":"verify-gate skill \u2014 install it before Tier 2 build to enforce evidence discipline"},{"path":"skills/hooks/SKILL.md","why":"hooks skill \u